{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765253,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"IPL Auction","festival_id":521073,"organization_id":2084904,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-15T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"quizzes","public_url":"quiz\/ipl-auction-commquest26-commercium-the-commerce-society-pgdav-college-m-university-of-delhi-1765253","region":"offline","details":"<p>Participants step into the shoes of an IPL franchise, showcasing cricket knowledge and strategic skills. From a rapid-fire online quiz to a live mega auction, this event tests both expertise and tactical thinking under pressure. Outsmart rivals, bid smartly, navigate hidden player ratings, and build your dream team to prove you&rsquo;re the true IPL mastermind!<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Online IPL Eliminator<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A fast-paced 30-MCQ quiz (10 minutes) testing IPL expertise, player stats, historical records, and auction trivia. Top 10 participants advance to the finals.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Final Round &ndash; IPL Mega Auction (Offline)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Qualifiers enter the live auction arena with a pre-defined purse to build an 11-player squad. Bid strategically across player categories, manage budget constraints and unveil hidden challenges to achieve the highest team rating!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Guidelines<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Eligibility: Open to Undergraduate Students.<\/li>\n<li>Format: Top 10 individual qualifiers earn franchise management rights for the final auction.<\/li>\n<li>Rules: English language; no use of mobiles, tablets, or external resources during the event. Any misconduct leads to direct disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Decisions: Decisions of the organizers and judges will be final.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>In case of any doubt, kindly contact below<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Utkarsh Garg - 8233139514<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Umang - 8795522846<\/strong><\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33504104,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T13:58:44+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T18:48:23+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"KNXbRsF","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":5,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-03 14:37:22","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6ac1105af025d_copy_of_commercium_the_commerce_society_1.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6ac1105af025d_copy_of_commercium_the_commerce_society_1.png","regnRequirements":{"id":2496894,"opportunity_id":1765253,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":4,"min_team_size":2,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-05T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-10T23:59:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":0,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"eligibility":"{\"sector\":[\"students\"],\"engineering\":[],\"bSchools\":[],\"arts\":[],\"medicine\":[],\"law\":[],\"others\":[\"all\"],\"experience\":[\"all\"],\"studentPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"all\"],\"fresherPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"a