ly one correct answer.<br \/>- The questions will cover IPL history, teams, players, auctions, records, statistics, captains, and notable IPL moments.<\/p>\n<p>Time &amp; Marking<\/p>\n<p>- Total time: 10 minutes.<br \/>- Each correct answer carries +1 marks.<br \/>- An unattempted or incorrect question carries 0 marks.<br \/>- Maximum possible score: 30 marks.<\/p>\n<p>Important Rules<\/p>\n<p>1. Each team is allowed only one attempt.<br \/>2. Once the quiz begins, the timer will start automatically and cannot be paused or restarted.<br \/>3. Participants must complete and submit the quiz within the allotted time. No additional time will be provided.<br \/>4. Participants are advised to ensure a stable internet connection before beginning the quiz.<br \/>5. Use of external resources, internet searches, AI tools, or assistance from any other person is strictly prohibited.<br \/>6. Any attempt to use unfair means, manipulate the platform, or share answers during the quiz may result in disqualification.<br \/>7. Participants should read each question carefully before submitting an answer.<br \/>8. Once the quiz is submitted, responses cannot be changed.<br \/>9. In case of a tie in score, lower quiz completion time will be considered as the first tie-breaker.<br \/>10. The top 10 teams based on the final score will qualify for the next round &mdash; the IPL Mega Auction.<br \/>11. The decision of the organisers shall be final and binding in all matters concerning the quiz and qualification.<\/p>\n<p>Important: Please make sure you are ready before clicking Start Quiz, as the timer begins immediately.<\/p>","entity_id":485190,"entity_type":"App\\Models\\AssessmentRound\\AssessmentRound","created_at":"2026-10-03T14:46:26+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-03T14:46:26+05:30","deleted_at":null,"type_guideline":1,"rule_visibility":1}],"has_audio_question":false,"has_video_question":false,"has_typing_test":false,"is_proctoring_enabled":true,"proctoring_new":{"full_screen":true,"a